type: software
title: "VisionData Gate"
authors:
  - name: "VisionData Gate contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dukeandBaron/visiondata-gate"
url: "https://github.com/dukeandBaron/visiondata-gate"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A local industrial-vision data review and delivery workbench combining
  deterministic checks, versioned evidence, governed agent workflows and
  human-controlled decisions. Synthetic benchmarks and reference-learning
  results do not establish industrial performance or production authorization.
